%% title: Three views of the same results
%% desc: You pick an exam and, if you want, a section. If the results are processed or published, three tabs show the same results: the merit list with everyone by position, the failed or absent students, and the pass/fail counts for each subject. Any open tab can be printed or downloaded as a CSV. A draft exam shows nothing.
flowchart LR
  A["Pick an exam<br/>and a section"]:::teacher --> R{"Results processed<br/>or published?"}:::note
  R -->|"No (draft)"| N["Nothing shown:<br/>Results are not ready yet"]:::note
  R -->|"Yes"| T1["Merit list<br/>everyone by position"]:::admin
  R -->|"Yes"| T2["Failed or absent<br/>failed, or absent in a subject"]:::admin
  R -->|"Yes"| T3["Pass/fail by subject<br/>counts for each subject"]:::admin
  T1 --> P["Print or<br/>Download CSV"]:::guardian
  T2 --> P
  T3 --> P
  classDef teacher fill:#e7f5ff,stroke:#1c7ed6,color:#0b3d66
  classDef admin fill:#fff4e6,stroke:#e8590c,color:#7a2e05
  classDef guardian fill:#ebfbee,stroke:#2b8a3e,color:#14411d
  classDef note fill:#f1f3f5,stroke:#868e96,color:#343a40
